# Repository Quality Gate

After meaningful changes, apply the repository-wide [quality-gate skill](../../../.github/skills/quality-gate/SKILL.md). It is the authoritative shared checklist for both add-on projects.

Before a One.com release, also apply `.github/skills/quality-checklist/SKILL.md` for project-specific version and release requirements.

